1
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:14,260
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:19,300
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:23,646
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:25,107 --> 00:00:26,415
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,022 --> 00:00:30,542
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,116 --> 00:00:34,484
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,484 --> 00:00:37,236
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,265 --> 00:00:40,545
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,249 --> 00:00:44,001
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:49,800
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:54,158
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:55,667 --> 00:01:00,979
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:01,789 --> 00:01:04,349
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:04,826 --> 00:01:07,898
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,359 --> 00:01:14,735
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:17,359 --> 00:01:20,623
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 13=

17
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,000
Everything looks fine.

18
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,120
All your test results are normal.

19
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:30,560
That dizzy spell you had

20
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:31,760
was probably

21
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,160
caused by stress.

22
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:38,040
And there's no sign

23
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,040
of secondary head injury

24
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,920
from fainting or hitting your head.

25
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:40,600
Don't worry.

26
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:41,520
You're fine.

27
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:42,840
Thank you, Doctor.

28
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:47,000
You really need to pay more attention
to personal hygiene.

29
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,080
Shower more often,

30
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:50,200
or you could develop a skin condition.

31
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,760
Could you take a look at this?

32
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,360
What have you been in contact with?

33
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:00,680
Is it serious?

34
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,520
Is it an allergic reaction?

35
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,680
It looks like contact dermatitis

36
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:04,720
or a fungal infection.

37
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,480
You should see a dermatologist
and get it checked properly.

38
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,720
Don't touch anything you shouldn't.

39
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:11,880
Take better care of yourself.

40
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,200
(Nurses' Station)
Excuse me, where's dermatology?

41
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:19,440
It's over there.

42
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,400
Move over a little. He stinks.

43
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,080
Keep your voice down.

44
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,320
He could have an infectious disease.

45
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,000
Come on, let's go.

46
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,080
What's that smell?

47
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,920
He really stinks.

48
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,320
I know. I can smell him from here.

49
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,480
What's that smell?

50
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,640
You don't smell rot like that every day.

51
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,560
Get it checked out already.

52
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,360
I don't smell anything.

53
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,040
Exactly.

54
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:48,800
Let's put a mask on.

55
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:55,960
Wait! Hold it!

56
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,680
What's going on?

57
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,960
What's that smell?

58
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,120
It stinks.

59
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:08,080
Stay away.

60
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,200
Is it him?

61
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:11,320
I don't know.

62
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:44,600
Honey,

63
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,720
is the power out again?

64
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:48,800
(Don't turn on the lights.)

65
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,240
(It's more romantic this way.)

66
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:09,680
Chen Mo,

67
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,400
can you act normal for once?

68
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:12,680
You didn't answer my calls

69
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:13,880
or my messages on WeChat.

70
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:15,680
I thought something happened to you!

71
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:16,600
Then what were you doing?

72
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,320
Trying to kidnap me?

73
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,000
Screw you.

74
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:21,400
I thought someone had broken in

75
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,640
and was up to no good.

76
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:23,840
You look like the bad guy.

77
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,800
Why'd you come here acting so weird?

78
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:27,760
You quit the stunt double gig

79
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,360
without even telling me.

80
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:31,520
Do you know how much trouble
you caused me?

81
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,320
Sorry.

82
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,440
It completely slipped my mind.

83
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:38,200
It's fine.

84
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:39,920
I got fired anyway.

85
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,200
Good.

86
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,920
A real job beats working on a film set.

87
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,400
Oh,

88
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,240
one more thing.

89
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,200
Did you know Lin Duo went missing

90
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:49,720
the day you went to the hospital?

91
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,760
I had no idea.

92
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,480
What happened to Lin Duo?

93
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,760
She disappeared.

94
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:03,960
Are you nuts?

95
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:04,680
I'm serious!

96
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:05,640
Then who's in there?

97
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:06,840
Who's in there?

98
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,080
Lin Duo's at your place?

99
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,400
More likely, you've got
a Lin Duo lookalike doll in there.

100
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:11,040
That'd make sense.

101
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,240
I told you,
and you still don't believe me?

102
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:12,920
Come in.

103
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,200
The shoot's on hold.

104
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,080
The female lead's missing.

105
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:15,920
We can't just recast her.

106
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,040
If Lin Duo's here,

107
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,440
she should at least pay me
what I'm owed.

108
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:22,560
What are you doing?

109
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,240
Setting the mood?

110
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,000
Let me show you

111
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,600
what a real surprise looks like.

112
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:31,600
All right.

113
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,720
Surprise!

114
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,360
Explain it to me.

115
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,240
What's the surprise?

116
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:47,800
Lin Duo.

117
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:49,920
Where are you?

118
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,960
Explain it.

119
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,320
Honey?

120
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,240
I'm asking you to explain.

121
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,320
I'm telling you to shut up.

122
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:58,440
Fine.

123
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:04,920
This is good.

124
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,080
Now that's a surprise.

125
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,800
The surprise is ring-a-ling.

126
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:34,680
Holy moly.

127
00:07:58,400 --> 00:07:58,880
Honey,

128
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,240
Chen Mo's here.

129
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,200
Just letting you know.

130
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,080
Okay.

131
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:08,840
Surprise!

132
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,600
How do you like it?

133
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,040
Yeah, what a surprise, buddy.

134
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,040
Do that again.

135
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,440
Just one more time.

136
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,280
Okay, go.

137
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,080
Surprise!

138
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,040
How do you like it?

139
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:25,040
Start again from "Honey."

140
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,120
Honey,

141
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,760
Chen Mo's here.

142
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:29,560
Just letting you know,

143
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:30,960
so you don't get startled later.

144
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:36,720
You can film me.

145
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,280
Why are you filming my wife
taking a shower?

146
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,320
Are you nuts?

147
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:39,880
Get out!

148
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:41,760
Get out!

149
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,240
Get out.

150
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:46,680
Honey,

151
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,880
I'm taking Chen Mo downstairs.

152
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:48,600
(Okay.)

153
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,560
What's wrong?

154
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,320
Don't you want your pay?

155
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:00,320
Buddy,

156
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,480
I was going to transfer here for work,

157
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,600
but now it looks like

158
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,080
you're better suited to it than I am.

159
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:08,680
I...

160
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:13,400
(Cai Yicai, Counselor)

161
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:16,720
What's that supposed to mean?

162
00:09:18,280 --> 00:09:18,800
Honey.

163
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:23,800
Honey,

164
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,360
that was fast.

165
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:29,360
Chen Mo just left.

166
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,600
Why did he leave?

167
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:32,480
He said

168
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,720
you disappeared halfway through filming,

169
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,120
so the production fell apart.

170
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:37,880
Right.

171
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,360
Why did you stop filming?

172
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,240
It's not that I quit.

173
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:44,280
They ran overtime every day.

174
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,160
That wasn't in my contract.

175
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,040
Things on set are complicated.

176
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,600
I'll explain it all to you later.

177
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,600
Then call them back when you can

178
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:53,840
so they don't spread rumors.

179
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:56,280
What rumors?

180
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:58,120
They say...

181
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,320
Who cares what they say?

182
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,000
They're all idiots.

183
00:10:07,160 --> 00:10:08,360
Honey, you smell so good.

184
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,560
You smell like me, too.

185
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:17,680
I love you,

186
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:18,720
honey.

187
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,600
I love you more.

188
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,640
What's wrong?

189
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:01,800
It's nothing.

190
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,440
My back's a little itchy.

191
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,160
I'll scratch it for you.

192
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,880
Take this twice a day,
morning and evening.

193
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:05,880
Always after meals.

194
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:08,320
What's that smell?

195
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:10,120
Hi. I'm looking for Dr. Sun.

196
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,680
Let me see.

197
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,720
When did this guy last shower?

198
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,440
He stinks.

199
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:16,840
Is he sick or something?

200
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,080
What were you muttering?

201
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:21,840
I didn't say anything.

202
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:23,920
What smell? Do I smell?

203
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,080
You're the one who stinks.

204
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:29,600
You're all disgusting!

205
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:31,240
Why are you covering your nose?

206
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:32,440
Do I stink?

207
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,680
Are you nuts?

208
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:34,600
What...

209
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:35,760
What's your problem?

210
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,080
Don't fight!

211
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:37,720
Just let it go.

212
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,000
Let's just keep our distance.

213
00:12:40,040 --> 00:12:41,120
He stinks,
and we're not even allowed to say it?

214
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,680
He stinks, and he started the fight.

215
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:43,640
Psycho.

216
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:45,680
Are you okay?

217
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,200
I can't stand this.

218
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:48,400
Let's go. Come on.

219
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,880
I was going to transfer here for work,

220
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:00,520
but now it looks like

221
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,080
you're better suited to it than I am.

222
00:13:09,185 --> 00:13:12,545
(Cai Yicai Counseling Clinic)

223
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,240
(Sister, these robes)

224
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,160
(fit me perfectly.)

225
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,080
(You're wearing my court robes.)

226
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:23,360
(If word gets out, you'll be charged
with insulting the throne.)

227
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,480
(Take them off at once.)

228
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:25,520
(Yours?)

229
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:29,280
(We both married
into the Commandery Prince's family.)

230
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:31,600
(I'm the heir's lawful wife.)

231
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,560
(You married a lowly concubine's son.)

232
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,320
(Yet your husband became a marquis
and chancellor,)

233
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:37,560
(and you were granted a noble title,)

234
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:39,120
(while I was divorced and cast aside.)

235
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:41,240
(How is that fair?)

236
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:43,160
(You used your status
as the heir's wife)

237
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,320
(to bully those weaker than you.)

238
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,600
(And now look at you...)

239
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:05,040
I-I...

240
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:06,160
I'm not going back in there.

241
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,500
(11:29)

242
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,080
How do you feel?

243
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:40,400
Exhausted.

244
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,120
Let's listen to this.

245
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:47,680
(Who are you?)

246
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,120
(Why are you here?)

247
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,440
(I'm Zhang Yongsen.)

248
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:54,760
(I need to save someone.)

249
00:14:55,680 --> 00:14:56,280
(Who?)

250
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,040
I don't remember any of it.

251
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:03,480
It's normal not to remember.

252
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:04,320
Just relax.

253
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,440
In your subconscious,

254
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:10,520
there's someone
with a personality nothing like yours.

255
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,880
But I can't be sure yet.

256
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:14,920
Let's stop here for today.

257
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,320
Already?

258
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,160
Time passes differently
in your subconscious

259
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:22,160
than it does in real life.

260
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:26,360
(Time passes differently
in each universe.)

261
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:30,000
We've been here for two hours.

262
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:31,400
But you may feel

263
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:32,720
like it's just been a few minutes.

264
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:41,120
Who have you been with lately?

265
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:42,880
My wife.

266
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:45,320
What's her name?

267
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,040
Lin Duo.

268
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:15,920
Mr. Zhang.

269
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:17,600
Mr. Zhang?

270
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:21,600
See you next time.

271
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:47,800
Where are you?

272
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:49,560
I don't know.

273
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:51,480
What are you doing?

274
00:17:54,360 --> 00:17:55,240
I'm running.

275
00:17:56,800 --> 00:17:57,880
I'm running nonstop.

276
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:00,720
I can't find a way out.

277
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:03,880
I'm so scared.

278
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:05,480
Take a closer look.

279
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:10,920
- Stop prying.
- (Stop prying.)

280
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:12,600
- This is none of your business.
- (This is none of your business.)

281
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:14,600
Who are you?

282
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:16,440
Why are you here?

283
00:18:19,040 --> 00:18:20,120
I'm Zhang Yongsen.

284
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:21,960
I'm here to...

285
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:25,600
I need to save someone.

286
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:27,600
Who?

287
00:18:28,917 --> 00:18:30,837
- What makes you think you can?
- (What makes you think you can?)

288
